findings.description:
Task 15 combines:

- the full format, lint, typecheck, build and test run;
- file-size checks;
- the before/after diff against `main` in a temporary worktree;
- a clone of a real repository;
- a live `claude -p` run;
- an MCP-client run, which may end up `BLOCKED:`.

It is cohesive as a final gate. Splitting the automated checks from the walkthrough would let the automated half finish and be committed even if the MCP-client step blocks. This is optional.
